             space character, the space character code itself is represented using the
             string "space". If the code is followed by a number it means the number
             of characters cells width it takes, if not set it takes one cell.
Next lines: using PIXEL_DOT_TRUE and PIXEL_DOT_FALSE, are drawn the characters.
            Each character first column is empty and next columns define the
            character.

Each cell has one extra bottom row and one extra right column pixels. These can be used
for characters that wish to be connected each other across cells.
